            "notes": "For your second power pick up [Comfy Cloud](item_d975b671-2810-4ce3-a367-32b075c39f91). The original build puts it the best:\n\n    With how easy sleep are to hit, Comfy clouds is the perfect combo. Shug your sleep \n    in the enemy and you'll most likely sleep 1-2 person(s). Throw a nade and you win\n    the teamfight. Super good. (Smoudge.#0, 3)\n\nI slept on it until recently, but for perks [Lethal Dose](item_b919494d-1a33-408a-ba2b-7e3cc24b59c8) is another great buy. With all these buffs to your sleep, you can in fact solo kill anyone on your backline with relative ease.",
