            "created_at": "2025-08-01T04:59:41.06721+00:00",
            "notes": "Grabbing [Dash Boots](item_1ec670c7-a465-4ca0-9d16-aeeedab7894e) and [Potent Projectiles](item_7e9a8017-9458-4318-aea9-5e80ba7e3c46) here should set us up quite nicely to farm cash going into round 5.\n\nDash Boots seriously is such a great perk. It gives Ana a huge amount of mobility, which combined with the extra health from [Sleep Regimen](item_28934e4f-0668-482e-b10d-a5d557cc3b1e) makes you very hard to kill. If you're like me you can also bind jump to your scroll wheel and b-hop around the map like a dork.\n\nIf you have any extra money I would put it into whatever weapon power perks you can afford.",
