            "created_at": "2025-08-01T04:59:41.06721+00:00",
            "notes": "For your power on round 5 I would stick with [No Scope Needed](item_823db5eb-5a24-4bac-b850-0aa34e76b4f6).\n\n**Ok, This is finally where I start to deviate from the original build:**\n[Hardlight Accelerator](item_0390c8af-2a68-4da2-b876-93da32c3f448) is the new hotness that I think has a ton of potential for Ana. The hidden tech is that ***Dash Boots procs it!!!***\n\nWhether you're following up after a sleep/nade or trying to keep your teammates healthy as you reposition, this gives you an instant +5 WP every 3 seconds. An absolute game changer.\n\nFinally, if you have the money upgrade [Potent Projectiles](item_7e9a8017-9458-4318-aea9-5e80ba7e3c46) to [Unscoped Resources](item_64c401f6-7508-4fc7-ac3a-93c9f3f57e2b)",
